WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:36.110
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.120
My Aoki award-winning novelist Mama,
and her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.120
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.790
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:44.790
DAIJO-BU!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.120
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:52.380
The man who plays my father in "Late-Night
Chaos Theater," Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.130
Sana-chan?

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.850
It's so warm...

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.730
"My Boyfriend is Like a Father To Me"

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.320
I remember writing my essay...

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.490
I had to make it in time,
so I wrote without sleeping...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.200
and then the Indian panda came to make
some curry with pickled veggies,

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.500
and I fell asleep...

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.500
You're still not completely awake.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.750
Sana-chan, you're awake. Good morning.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.090
Aah! What is Gojo-san doing in my bed!?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.430
No, this is my bed.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:43.100
What is Gojo-san's bed doing in my home!?

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.640
This is my home.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.770
What a disgracefuloose girl I am!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.770
May Oda Buddha-sama
and Chri-holyghost-sama, forgive me!!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:54.770
--How could I have committed
such an indiscretion
--Disgracefuloose?

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:58.440
--with a gentleman I just barely met!?
--It's a cross between
"disgraceful" and "loose."

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.450
Now that it's happened, would you mind
having me as your mistress, sir?

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:05.790
I'm not very experienced,
but I beseech your everlasting favor.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.450
Sana-chan, are you
deliberately putting me on?

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.620
No...

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.040
"Sana learns the truth"

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.040
Take it easy!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.460
Oh, then I'm still a wholesome young girl.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.800
That's embarrassing. So, what time is it?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.800
3 o'clock.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.130
Afternoon? Morning?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.800
Afternoon.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.050
Which means...

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:26.810
Oh, no!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.020
I'll be late for school!

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:32.770
Surprised you?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.440
What is this?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.070
Oh, I just wanted to startle you, Sana-chan,

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.730
so after I put you to bed,

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.400
I fought back against my own drowsiness
and worked hard to make that.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.410
Don't work so hard on stuff like that!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.490
Anyhow, take it easy.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:48.870
Sana-chan, you're still wearing pajamas,
and school is long since over.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:55.080
Sana-chan, you're safe?
Man, I rang your Burutcha over and over!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:04:00.420
Sensei, Sana-chan is safe. She fell asleep
in the park, and Gojo-san helped her out.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.430
Hmm, and?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:06.260
Gojo-san said he would bring
her home now. Isn't that great?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.140
Sana-chan, you must be hungry.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.440
Should we get something to eat first?

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.690
Mm-hmm!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.770
Look! Funny birds all of a sudden!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.860
Usually, you release doves
when you do that, right?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:25.490
Kurata Sana and a
middle-aged actor, huh? Interesting...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.780
I'm just saying,
you've got lousy taste in clothes.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.290
"Dreaming Pro's evil scheme"

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.420
It isn't cool to eat a hamburger
with both hands.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.090
There is no style when it comes to eating.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.760
Take-chan, you're not very cool.
Minus 20 points!

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.090
Take-chan? Take-chan?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.640
Take-chan, this one, this one.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.770
Kurata Sana, just you watch.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.810
You're going to be steeped in scandal.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.780
Now, at this point,
here's this week's Sana-chan.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.450
I'm home! Take-chan brought me-

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.120
Since when have you been
such a wayward young girl?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.450
You took on the responsibility of
staying up all night to write your essay.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.660
Not only do you fall asleep on a park bench

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.460
and get taken in by a man
none of us know anything about,

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.460
but you got an
unexcused absence at school,

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.800
slept for hours at that man's house,

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.460
and after making one
happy-go-lucky phone call home,

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.130
you finally come wandering in at this hour.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.130
That's a fine how-do-you-do!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:31.060
Gojo-san is not some man that
none of us knows anything about!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.230
It is decidedly highly possible
that it could have been a man

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.060
that none of us knew anything about.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.520
You should be grateful that
you're even still alive right now.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.150
Sensei has been worried
about you this whole time.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.740
I'm sorry, Mama...

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.410
Rei-kun, I'm sorry.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.080
It's okay.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:59.420
I ought to go pay my respects
to this gentleman, Gojo-san.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.880
However...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.840
"Speaking of Gojo Takeshi-san..."

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.170
Good morning.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.420
This morning, there is sensational news
that child TV personality...

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.760
...Kurata Sana-san does
indeed have a father!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:13.760
Her father is middle-aged
actor Gojo Takefumi-san, 41...

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:18.440
It's not "Takefumi," it's "Takeshi,"
for crying out loud...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.860
"Father? Huh~!?"

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:25.440
It's always the same with them, huh?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.450
Those bastards! This is Drea-Pro's doing!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.110
What are they, idiots?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.410
Huh? That's our apartment.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.750
This is a seed that you sowed, right?
Deal with it yourself.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.080
R- r- right...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.870
We're here in front of
Kurata Sana-chan's house.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.080
There are many reporters gathered here-

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:44.090
Hi! Good morning! Thank you for
coming here for such an absurd scoop!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.760
Ah, it's Sana-chan!
Sana-chan has appeared!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.430
Is it true that Gojo-san is your father?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.760
'Course he's not.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:53.430
But any way you look at these photos,
it's a father with his daughter!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.100
How come? How come it has to
be a father with his daughter?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.770
You're not father and daughter!?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.890
No matter how you look at these photos,

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.440
it appears to be a father
with his daughter, doesn't it?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.480
Why's that? No matter
how you look at them,

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.110
it looks like a couple of lovers,
doesn't it?

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:10.110
Take-chan, are you watching?
I love you, you, you!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.740
Don't say "I love you"!
Good grief, what a girl!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.660
"She announced that they were lovers!"

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:16.450
--Take-chan, are you watching?
I love you, you, you!
--Damn it, she's a persistent little brat.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.450
Sana-chan, not bad.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:23.460
Now I'm getting angry. I'm going to
have to think of what to do next.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.800
You guys are persistent, too.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.130
"That's all for Drea-Pro's
evil schemes for today."

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:32.050
Sana-chan, I saw the TV this morning.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.720
I announced that we
were lovers without thinking.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:39.060
I love that sort of thing.
I give you 100 points.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.390
Surprised you?

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.730
Nope. Take-chan, your same
old magic tricks get 0 points.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:48.070
Okay, our couple with the gossip
about them, we're about ready to go!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.740
All right, let's go, Margarine!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.070
You bet, Honey.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.700
"Margarine"? Does she mean "My darling"?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.910
Okay, this is a take! Start!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.090
Okay, out! 20 minute break.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.090
Really, Rumiko-chan,
your performance is- how shall I say?-

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:16.720
you know, fit for the role of the heroine,
is that what I'm saying?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.100
Sana-chan, this is your boyfriend,
who's 30 years older than you, right?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.440
This is Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.980
I'm Gojo. "Takeshi" is written
like the word for "warrior,"

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.440
plus the word for "history."

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.700
Hey, what is this? I'm the star here, right?
Go say something to them, Producer!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:36.370
Of course I will, Rumi-chan!
I'll go give them a good talking-to!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.410
This really won't do!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.040
Sagami-san!

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.410
Oh, Tsu-san. Sorry about the commotion.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.750
That's okay. It's a great help to have this
many reporters here on a late-night drama.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.420
With any luck, our ratings could go up!

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.420
But isn't the 30-year difference
in your ages a bit unnatural?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:55.090
No, as long as there's love,
the difference in our ages is nothing.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.760
It's not as though I'm going to be
in elementary school my whole life.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.430
In short time, I'll be in middle school, so...

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.770
I'll be in middle school soon?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.060
In middle school?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:12.070
Aah, I forgot! Tomorrow, I've got Guidance!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.490
"Guidance"

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.490
What's Guidance?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.070
Ah, that's it, huh?

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.120
That's a line dance.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.790
I've got some work tomorrow
that I just can't get out of.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.460
Could you ask your teacher to
change this to a different day?

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.050
That's okay. I'll do what
I need to by myself.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.170
But everyone else's parents
will be coming, right?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.050
I didn't go to Natsumi's either.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:42.390
No problem. It's not like I'm going
to test for any other middle schools.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:45.390
It's not like advancing is that big a deal.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.060
Guidance?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.400
What are you doing!?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.400
I just can't make it tomorrow.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.730
Why not!? Why not!?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.400
I'd like to go if I could,

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.740
but tomorrow, I have an important
information-gathering meeting

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.740
that has been set up for a year now.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.410
You're mean!
You're abandoning your daughter!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.410
If it was that important a function,
why did you forget about it?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:06.080
You just need to listen closely
to what your teachers tell you.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.830
Okay, okay, understood! I'm going to bed!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.800
"Singing Guidance"

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:17.800
♪ An interview by myself for Guidance. ♪

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:23.430
♪ You're so dumb, you cannot advance. ♪

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:29.440
♪ If you all want to laugh at me,
I'll make an allowance. ♪

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:34.690
♪ I'll dance on the dresser for Guidance. ♪

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.360
--Good night!
--All done?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.360
Um, I realize this is sudden,
but this is Gomi-kun's house.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.200
It's still not too late,
even now, Shinichi-san.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.700
Take the entrance exam for
Kaimei Middle School for me.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.370
You'll go to Kaimei Middle School too,
same as your brother.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.710
I'm worried about your future if you go
to Jinbo Middle School, Shinichi-san.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.710
I can't get into Kaimei.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.380
That's okay.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.710
"Gomi's mother"

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.710
I'll get a tutor for you,
like we did for your brother.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:03.720
"Kaimei Middle School Enrollment Guide"

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.720
Your father and your brother
both got into Kaimei.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:03.720
Kaimei Middle... Wah! This is
an incredibly smart school!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:07.390
Brother has always been smart.
I'll be fine going to Jinbo Middle.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.390
Shinichi-san, you can do it if you try.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.060
I'm home.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.730
It's your father.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.940
Remember, Shinichi-san, you're going
to Kaimei Middle with your brother.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.160
Shinichi, you're going
to test for Kaimei Middle?

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.200
"Gomi's father"

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.990
You don't say, you don't say.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.410
Still, I'm impressed that
he's made up your mind to.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.540
Well, sure he has...

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.430
All right, it's done!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:44.760
"Go to sleep"

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.760
Yow...

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.010
"Good little children should be asleep"

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.010
Get to bed!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.020
Shinichi-san you can do it if you try.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.100
All right, wonderful!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.440
What do you want!?

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.110
Just kidding...

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:01.780
Grade-schoolers shouldn't
be out playing at this hour.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.110
Catch you later, Gomi-kun!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.070
Bye-bye!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.160
Dumbass!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.800
Hayama-san...

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.470
You okay?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.130
What do you mean?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.800
Nothing.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.140
Doing your karate training?

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.640
Yeah.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:53.750
"Babbit's drawing song"

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.950
Rice cake, bump, bump,
line, line, triangle,

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.950
raindrop with a heart in it,
draw the wings,

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.790
and it's Babbit!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:13:04.170
"Produce a relief sculpture for graduation"

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.290
Please be quiet.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.960
I would like to discuss the
relief sculpture for graduation.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.170
Please give some suggestions as to
what sort of pictures would be good.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.640
A picture of Principal Narunaru's head!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.930
Split end!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.310
Oh, that might be funny, Sensei.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:15.310
No. Be serious!
Think seriously about this.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.310
This is dumb.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.980
Please think about this seriously.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.650
It's hard to focus on graduation, huh?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:23.650
We'll all be going to
Jinbo Middle School together, anyhow.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:24.650
Good morning!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.990
Sana-chan, you're late.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:26.990
What's that?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.320
Ta-da!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.330
Since my mom can't come,
this is Mama Mk II!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.250
Sana-chan, your mother
isn't coming to Guidance?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.250
"Thank you for looking after my Sana."

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.580
Any other ideas?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.920
--Yakiniku!
--Why?

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.590
--That strange white bat.
--What do you mean?

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:40.590
--Furikake seasoning.
--Huh?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:44.090
Think of something more normal!
This is a graduation ceremony!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.920
"Guidance time"

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.920
After school...

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.590
I told you not to bring any candy.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.260
But today we have something we need to

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.930
"6th Year 3rd Class
Guidance Meeting Room"

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.270
ask of your teacher, so this is special.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:55.270
Come now, Shinichi-san,
your collar is crooked.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.350
I can do it myself.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.280
"Oh, is Father Hayama not coming?"

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.280
No.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.950
"Oh, he's not? Well then..."

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.700
Father Mk II! Want to
borrow him when I'm done?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.950
You're causing another stir in public,
like you always do, huh?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.960
Huh? Oh, you mean Take-chan?
Does that bother you?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.960
Not really.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.630
--I'm leaving!
--Well then, goodbye.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.960
Kurata-san, please.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.970
All right, here goes.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.300
Hey, this thing...

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.260
Sana-chan!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.930
Rei-kun!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:34.930
I'm her guardian.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.940
Sana-chan, Sensei was concerned
about you being by yourself,

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.900
so she asked me to accompany you.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.560
Oh, well if you were coming,
you should have said so earlier!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.570
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.440
"It was a little slice of hell"

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.900
Ah! It's the wrinkled hag!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.410
My word, this is a scandal unbecoming
an elementary school student!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.280
This is an alarming matter!

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.620
What kind of vulgar gossip is this!?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.870
Well, about that incident...

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.920
There are a number of obstacles
unique to the entertainment world,

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.960
and there are extenuating circumstances,
you see...

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.250
Unique to the entertainment world?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.630
I love you!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.680
Well, in that case,
out of respect for Zenjiro-san,

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.970
I will overlook it this time.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.140
Why is she bringing up Zenjiro?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.640
Math...

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.930
Math?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.600
Kurata-san, you've been making quite
an effort since then, haven't you?

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.900
Of course she has!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.270
Not good enough!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.650
Unless she produces results,
that's not good enough!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.320
Unless she makes up what she has
fallen behind in by graduation in March,

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.240
I cannot go along with her
attending Jinbo Middle School!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.910
Zenjiro...

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.240
W- what was that?

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.910
Come to think of it, Zenjiro-san was
saying something to me earlier...

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.910
What?

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:42.920
That there was a kind,
pretty teacher at Sana-chan's school.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.920
Could he have been talking
about Andoh-sensei?

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.920
He did say that! He did say that! He said
he would never forget her sexy dance!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.920
I guess he might have been
talking about Andoh-sensei.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.260
Oh, I'm sure he was! I'm sure it's me!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.930
My, my, Zen-chan said that about me?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.930
Achoo! I nevuh said anything!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:59.270
Where did that suddenly come from?

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.270
Easy win!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.270
Our strategy worked, huh?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.600
Thanks to Zenjiro-san.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.270
Gomi-san, please.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.610
Shinichi-san...

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.230
"Gomi-kun's turn"

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.610
What did you just say?

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:15.620
I said I wanted you to let Shinichi
test for Kaimei Middle School.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.620
My, my, my!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.290
You're getting more wrinkles.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.290
Huh? They disappeared!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:23.960
It appears that Gomi-kun's mother is
not entirely aware of his situation.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.500
To be frank, right now, no matter
how you twist your son's grades,

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.510
classroom comportment,
and other considerations,

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.630
it would be impossible for him to be
accepted into Kaimei Middle School.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:32.880
There, you see?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.550
Now, let's put an end to this absurd joke,

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.680
and concentrate our efforts on
overcoming his weaker subjects,

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.560
so he can advance to Jinbo Middle School-

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.230
I will not let him advance
to Jinbo Middle School!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.230
What did you say?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.230
Mom!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.060
This boy's father went
to Kaimei Middle School.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.570
This boy's brother got
into Kaimei Middle School.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.570
So Shinichi can get in too, if he tries.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.570
Are you sure that the reason his grades
haven't shown any improvement...

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:55.910
...is because of an issue
with the content of the guidance

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:56.910
he is getting from the teachers here?

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.240
I never! How dare you say such a thing!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.250
Your face is cracking, lady.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.250
Gomi-kun, is this what you want?

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.250
I...

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.580
You're going to test for
Kaimei Middle School, right?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.590
You are aware of the regulations
of this school, aren't you?

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.920
If he tests for another school,
then even if he is rejected,

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:15.260
he will forfeit his eligibility
to advance to Jinbo Middle School.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.590
Of course I know that.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.260
Answer them, Shinichi-san.
You want to go to Kaimei Middle.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.600
I don't know.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.930
Shinichi-san!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.560
Mother, Shinichi-san appears
to still be undecided.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.940
Why don't you talk it over
with him again, and-

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:31.610
You keep quiet! You're the one responsible
for Shinichi falling behind in his studies!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.320
Mom!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.000
You okay?

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.580
Shinichi-san!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.840
E- excuse me...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.590
Shinichi-san!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:56.260
My word, what kind of parent is that?
For mercy's sakes!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:01.930
Gomi-kun...

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.470
Let's go have some fun.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.810
You have matters that come
before your grades

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.270
and your advancement consultation.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.610
Who do you have with you
from home today?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.490
You don't appear to realize how
important this Guidance meeting is,

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:16.950
do you, Hayama-kun?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.610
Once more!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.450
If you cause one more incident,

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:25.370
your advancement to Jinbo Middle School
will be in jeopardy.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.210
"Once more, and kerplunk!"

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.210
Hayama's in a pinch! One more strike!

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.290
Thank you, Zenjiro-sensei!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.210
What for?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.210
Thanks to you, Zenjiro-sensei, it looks
like I can safely move on to middle school,

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.220
so this is an expression of my thanks.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:40.220
Is that right? You didn't
have to go to the trouble!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:43.890
That goes for you guys, too!
I like canned peaches in heavy syrup,

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.020
and Osaka's famous
Kagetsu senbei crackuhs!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.230
You don't have to go to the trouble!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.230
--Okay, we won't!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:52.230
You guys really do think
a lot of your teachuh.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:56.230
Oh yeah, about this- you're causing quite
a stir out in the woild again, Sana-chan.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.240
Now you've got a codger boyfriend
who's thoity years olduh than you?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.910
Take-chan is not a codger!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.990
He's a feisty old codger!
He's so old, Sana-chan,

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.580
for someone still in elementary school
like you are,

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.910
he's the ultimate expression
of a preference for olduh men!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.250
You should talk, Zenjiro-sensei.
How do you like the older ladies?

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.580
Who, me? I'm awlmighty, you know!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.750
They are out there, after all-

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.920
attractive older ladies that are
head over heels for Zenjiro-sensei.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.590
Ah, I'm kind of getting
a chill down my spine.

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.930
Here you go,
Andoh Sumire-sensei's phone number!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.930
Then you did mean that old lady!?

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:26.430
The chills won't go away.
We're done for the day.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.140
"Cold evenings with you"

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:29.100
Now the chill is really coming on.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.270
Okay, scene 8!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.230
Achoo!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.980
Wow, during location shoots at night
when our waiting times are this long,

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.900
you get really cold, huh?

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.900
You know, my snot is collecting in
my mustache, and it's freezing there.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.240
That's nasty, Take-chan!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.870
When we press our bodies
together like this...

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.910
When we press our bodies
together like this?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.910
--Ah, it's so warm...
--Ah, it's so warm...

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.210
Take-chan, you're so warm.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:54.250
Sana-chan, you're warm, too.
We might just melt away...

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.130
I really have melted!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.590
Surprised you?

00:19:58.590 --> 00:19:59.920
Surprised me!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.260
That's in bad taste.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.890
It's all right!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.260
You're pretty good.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.560
Gomi-kun, you're pretty grown up.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.850
Huh?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.940
Gomi-kun?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:16.020
Hmm? Gomi-kun?

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.610
Good morning!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:19.940
Sana-chan, have you heard?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:20.610
What?

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.900
Gomi-kun is going to test
for Kaimei Middle.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.280
Oh? Is he really that smart?

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:29.240
"Shinichi-chan, your shirt is hanging out.
You have to be a good little boy."

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:33.120
"My Shinichi-chan is going to
test for Kaimei Middle School."

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.140
You spread it around to everyone!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.890
That was dirty!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.890
No, I didn't.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.180
Wait!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.900
Did something happen?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.230
Not really.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:01.230
You know, last night, I saw Gomi-kun.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:05.240
He went into a coffee shop with some kids
that had to be in middle school.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.820
Middle school?

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.750
I'm a little worried.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.660
"Hayama called into doubt"

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.890
That was a dirty thing to do.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.640
That was dirty!

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.060
What's the matter?
I thought you took karate.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:41.940
Get on with it.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:44.150
Nothing going on here.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.950
Hey...

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.740
Do it.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:02.300
I'm back.

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:04.300
Welcome home.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.630
Where's Akito?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:07.300
I'll bet he's on his way home.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.640
He is, huh?

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:12.640
Is that you, Akito? How was Guidance?

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:13.970
Okay.

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:15.310
It was, huh?

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.190
I brought home some sushi.

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.360
Sushi here!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.040
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:40.830
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.960
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.630
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.550
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:49.430
so resolve when to give up

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:51.390
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:52.760
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:54.390
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:57.020
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:59.520
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:02.060
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.730
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.570
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:10.030
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:12.320
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.240
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.580
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.420
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:25.710
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:27.630
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.470
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.390
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:35.260
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:37.180
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:39.100
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:40.980
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:42.900
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:47.820
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.490
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:52.410
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:54.320
so resolve when to give up

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:57.910
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:57.950 --> 00:24:00.120
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.120
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:03.500
(Mou man tail)

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.630
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.760
Gomi-kun, you've got it all wrong!

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:14.640
Hayama wasn't the one
who spread it around about you!

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:16.390
If you think calmly about it for a minute

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:18.640
you'll realize that he's the most
close-mouthed kid in all of history!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:22.310
Oh, but Gomi-kun just keeps sticking
his feet even deeper into the swamp.

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:24.600
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 44,

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:25.650
the tale of where Take-chan and Sana-chan,

00:24:25.650 --> 00:24:28.650
and Gomi-kun and Hayama's
relationships are headed:

00:24:28.650 --> 00:24:32.320
Gomi-kun, Gomi-kun, Where Are You Going?

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:33.610
When you go out,

00:24:33.610 --> 00:24:35.950
make sure you tell someone at home
where you are headed, okay?
